L1: Astaxanthin supplementation enhances metabolic adaptation with aerobic training in the elderly
L2: Physiological Reports (2021)
L3: Sophia Z. Liu, Ana P. Valencia, Matt P. VanDoren, Eric G. Shankland, Baback Roshanravan, Kevin E. Conley, David J. Marcinek
